@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@orderId = 1
@shipKey = replace-with-unique-ship-key
@deliverKey = replace-with-unique-deliver-key

### Ship a confirmed order (repeat with same key to replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{shipKey}}

### Deliver a shipped order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{deliverKey}}

### Read updated order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
